{"repositoryId":1217478130,"availability":"available","full":"NakuSurrey/pricing-ai-agent","name":"pricing-ai-agent","description":"Guardrailed agentic AI assistant for UK home insurance — RAG citations, indicative pricing, FCA Consumer Duty wording, prompt-injection blocking. LangGraph + Groq + ChromaDB + Streamlit, dockerised on Hetzner.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-21T23:38:11Z","updated":"2026-04-27T19:15:30Z","branch":"main","homepage":"http://46.225.208.197:8090","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agent","chromadb","docker","fastapi","fca-compliance","groq","guardrails","home-insurance","langgraph","prompt-injection","pydantic","python","rag","streamlit"],"demo":"http://46.225.208.197:8090/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T13:47:06.260Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T13:47:06.260Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T13:47:06.260Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T00:54:40.958Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T13:47:06.260Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A guardrailed agentic AI assistant that answers UK home insurance questions and produces indicative prices, with FCA Consumer Duty wording on every response and a citation back to the policy section it came from.","Home insurance pricing sits inside one of the most heavily regulated chat surfaces in the UK. Saying the wrong thing — \"you're guaranteed cover\", \"this is the cheapest\", \"your claim is always covered\" — is a Consumer Duty violation, not a typo. Most agent demos ignore this. This project treats it as the core constraint and builds the whole system around it: input guardrails first, intent classification second, deterministic tools third, LLM composition fourth, output guardrail last. The price you see is always indicative, the answer always cites a source, the refusal always has a reason."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/NakuSurrey/